From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 13:45:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Now-playing dashboard: artist portrait, bigger artwork,
 stream line and lyrics

The dashboard showed a small square of album art. It now shows the artist's portrait
(album art when there is none), sized to cover about half of a 16:9 screen, with the
text and timeline beside it in landscape. Under the title it shows the stream format
(codec, sample rate, bit depth for lossless, bitrate) from the server's custom data,
and it shows the track's lyrics, fetched once per track as the party dashboard does.

Helpers and their tests come first; the dashboard test stubs the lyrics clock, which
reads the queue API this test does not provide.
